WEBVTT

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:05.320
<i>Akari and Michelle are kidnapped 
by No. 4 Division's Bao.</i>

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:10.090
<i>But Joseph arrives, and the M.A.R.S. 
Ranking 1 fighter is enraged.</i>

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.590
<i>He fights everything by himself 
and solves their problems,</i>

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.170
<i>and then rescues the two of them.</i>

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.630
<i>Now, all that's left is to pray 
their friends can take back the Annex 1.</i>

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:23.590
A huge number of biomagnetic 
fields just disappeared.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:28.780
It's possible it was either poison gas, 
a biological weapon, or radiation,

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:29.960
but not a nuclear explosion.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:34.050
Any remaining bacteria will be disabled 
by the change in the amount of sunlight.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.060
Any poison gas will be blown away.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.360
The battle starts at sunrise.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.720
At dawn we'll infiltrate the Annex 1

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.520
and hack the communications 
tower No. 4 Division took over,

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:48.470
and then we tell the Earth that 
No. 4 Division has betrayed them.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.020
Whoever controls that tower 
controls the battle.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.720
Now it's our turn to take over!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.220
Colony

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:40.320
Time-wise, it should be about dawn.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.730
Wolf, what do you think?

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.780
Not yet. No. 4 Division 
is still staying put.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.520
I'm so hungry.

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:54.340
Keiji, got anything to eat?

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:55.070
No.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.160
Sorry.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.910
I used all the provisions.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.310
It's okay, Peggy.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.190
Even with your short-beaked echidna powers,

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:05.600
you dug all this way.

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:07.950
You needed the food.

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.400
Yeah.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.350
Marcos, Keiji-kun...

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.490
The milk of the short-beaked echidna 
has a lot of nutritional value.

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.160
They're researching it 
on Earth, too, I heard.

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:23.510
I can excrete it from my skin.

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:25.450
Go ahead.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.300
We're back in business.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:40.930
Let's go.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.370
We lost contact with Bao after he 
recovered the First and the Second.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.140
We'll go to back him up.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:51.490
You two are our fighters.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.200
You're right.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:55.970
Thanks.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:57.130
No hesitation, huh?

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:58.890
They're on the move!

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:04.920
The members of No. 4 Division 
are leaving the Annex 1!

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:09.880
Yes! They have no idea that 
we're about to sneak in.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.370
What do we have here?

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.820
This is Bao, I'm underground—

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.210
<i>They were here after all.</i>

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.320
We'll follow General Liu.

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:33.900
They probably don't know Hong 
is there. Just drag them out.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:37.440
Roger!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.510
Evacuate!

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:22.060
Okay, everyone!

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.450
Stop.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:28.320
Or she'll die.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.140
Guys...

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:02.000
Run!

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.470
Go, Peggy!

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:10.510
Right!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.050
Okay!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:14.990
There's no radiation!

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:16.680
The engineers need to get 
inside with me, now!

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.180
Wow, the wind's so strong!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.720
And the sunlight, too!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.620
We can do this! We can do it!

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:33.190
Peggy! Dig another hole 
away from the minefield!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:35.370
Get the non-combatants inside it!

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:53.720
This wind...

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.850
The terraformars are creating the wind!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.610
Are they blowing away the remaining poison?

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:07.690
Right at daybreak?

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:11.780
Did they come up with the same idea we did?

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.710
P-Peggy!

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:27.880
Damn it!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:28.570
Keiji!

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:29.590
Don't stop!

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.010
You have a job to do, right?

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.340
Run!

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.770
<i>Everyone, don't let them beat you, okay?</i>

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.720
<i>My narwhal powers let me dodge one attack.</i>

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:53.800
<i>But...!</i>

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.710
<i>No way! No way!</i>

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.230
<i>I can't dodge the second, there's no way!</i>

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:05.660
<i>A net? Isn't this the Annex's...</i>

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.130
<i>Large anti-terraformar net?!</i>

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.410
It's huge! It'll catch us!

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:11.510
Run!

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.920
Get inside the Annex 1!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.520
Did that not catch them?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.520
There's a lot of them over there, too.

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:48.660
Oh, I've been killed.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.540
How awful.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.450
But more will be born.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:56.430
Who the hell are you?

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.610
I mean... all of you!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:00.310
So, what's the plan?

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.940
Hmm, no need to tell you, maybe.

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:07.600
But I can answer the first question.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:11.140
I was born with nothing.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.130
The bare minimum of family reputation,

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:14.820
average abilities,

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:16.650
average brains.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:20.910
Even now, I'm just a career 
soldier doing a job.

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:26.310
But thanks to the surgery I 
gained an incredible power.

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:30.790
And thanks to that power I 
gained infinite possibilities.

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:32.790
Oh yeah?

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:36.230
Thanks for answering the 
question I didn't care about.

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.830
You're welcome.

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:40.140
Anyway...

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.160
Bye-bye.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:51.870
It's okay.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.110
They're dead.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.810
No external wounds.

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:56.990
No radiation.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:59.480
No strange gas flows either.

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:02.330
The only biomagnetic fields are 
still a long way away.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.310
Poison in the atmosphere...

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.670
Is this a bioweapon?

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:12.370
Even if it doesn't get any denser...

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:15.120
There's about 15 minutes until 
exposure will reach fatal levels.

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:17.680
Keiji, take my spare.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:24.980
15 minutes, huh?

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:27.030
They're coming...

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.880
From another entrance!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.220
K-Keiji!

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.690
Leave it to me. You guys go on ahead.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:45.570
Bring it.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:52.960
<b>Broadcast Tower

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:04.640
Amelia, shut the bulkhead.

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:06.470
R-Right!

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:15.290
<i>It'll take ten seconds for 
the bulkhead to close.</i>

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.920
<i>He's reading my movements.</i>

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:07.940
That's what happens when 
you take a jab to the jaw.

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:09.890
You get a concussion.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:17.700
And after the jab...

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:30.500
<i>I'm so glad I didn't have to fight a human.</i>

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.920
K-Keiji?

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.460
I beat him.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.530
Let's hurry to the control room.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:05.680
Tired?

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.470
No, you're scared.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.620
The edge you had earlier is completely gone.

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:13.800
Is it your first time killing a person?

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:15.740
It starts to get to you as 
time passes, doesn't it?

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:22.670
The me you just killed 
wanted to become a painter.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:30.410
Our DNA is the same, but we 
don't share personalities.

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:34.620
We're fighting this battle because it's 
the mission we've been ordered to do.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:37.200
We're just like you.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:41.520
When I get back to Earth, I want 
to become a famous martial artist.

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:43.680
I want to be a soccer player.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:44.840
I want to be a model.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:50.720
And your friend wants to 
be a major leaguer, right?

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.620
Want to make a trade?

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:58.780
If you agree to become my prisoner and help 
us lure out Hizamaru-kun and XO Michelle,

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:00.290
and you succeed,

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:03.740
I'll guarantee your life and 
the lives of your friends.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:04.220
Wha—

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.730
Shall I tell you why?

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.680
This area is about to 
doused with a bioweapon.

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:13.080
We have a bacteria type on our crew.

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:17.460
Those of your men who went inside 
the Annex 1 are doomed regardless.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.550
And one more thing.

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.510
This is a secret.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:29.400
The first ship to reach Mars 
won't be a U-NASA rescue ship,

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:30.870
it will be a battleship of ours.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:36.960
When that happens, you are all scheduled 
to be killed in an "accident".

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:39.820
You don't want that, do you?

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:43.700
You don't want to die, or lose your friends.

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.050
Or kill anyone.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:49.890
Are you serious?

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:52.660
Yes, I'm serious. Very serious.

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:58.330
A bacteria type and a battleship, huh?

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:01.460
So that's checkmate, I guess.

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:04.520
That's right. You have no hope.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.820
There are a lot of terraformars here so,

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:09.340
for now, let's go inside and seal it up.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:12.910
Well, I guess I don't have a choice.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.880
It's the only way to survive.

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:17.160
That's right.

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:20.800
Once we return you'll be 
held for a little while,

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.890
but I promise we'll return you to your 
countries after we're done with you.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.160
Yeah...

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:34.530
The guys who went inside didn't seem like 
the types who could even punch someone.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:39.740
Cockroaches are one thing, but I can't 
see them being able to kill a person.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:41.080
That goes for you, too.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.670
Yeah... Damn it.

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:47.200
You're not playing fair, anyway.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:49.180
How many of you are there?

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.360
I don't know.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:54.500
My surgery base is the tall urn ascidian.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:57.930
<b>Tall Urn Ascidian
Aplousobranchia Didemnidae Didemnum
A type of colonial tunicate that 
reproduces asexually by budding.
New organs and a brain are constructed while 
part of the body remains connected to the parent.
It also has a symbiotic relationship with the algae 
inside its body that enables it to perform photosynthesis
It reproduces asexually by budding.</b>

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.670
It reproduces asexually by budding.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:01.410
As long as I've got the energy, the 
materials, and the light, I can reproduce.

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:02.790
Infinitely.

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:06.750
Even I don't know how many of me there are.

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:09.140
There's no way for me to beat that.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:14.470
I'll feel a little bad for Akari and the XO,

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:20.910
but I'll be able to survive and Alex will 
probably be able to get to the Majors.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:24.410
You have to do what it takes 
to achieve your dreams, right?

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.610
That's right.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:28.760
Let's survive and make our dreams come true.

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:32.950
Haha. Sorry for killing 
one of you back there.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.780
It's actually been bothering 
me the whole time.

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.280
It's okay.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:40.110
It was an emergency, right?

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:42.150
From now on, let's both do our bes—

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:47.360
Everything you just said was screwed up.

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.440
If you were scared to fight,

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:52.040
if you were scared to lose 
your life and stability,

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.490
scared to kill someone even 
if they were an enemy...

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:57.030
if your resolve was that weak,

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:59.720
you'd never come to Mars in the first place!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:04.070
Why do you think I'm fighting 
in a situation like this?

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:08.470
Why do you think the captain and 
XO volunteered to go to Mars?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:13.130
Why did Keiji give up a peaceful life 
and risk that operation on his eyes?

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:18.710
Why did Wolf want to be an engineer so bad 
he was willing to join the Annex 1 crew?

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:22.670
Sheila and Eva, Peggy, and Erika...

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.770
Do you know why young girls,

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:30.270
who just happened to grow up a little poor,
 are on Mars, fighting cockroaches?

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:36.740
They've come here to fight because 
they refuse to ever, ever give up!

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:41.320
The soldiers, the non-combatants, 
every one of us!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:44.420
Are you serious?

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.450
So you're choosing to die in our battleship.

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:52.100
That's why we're here, to tell 
everyone about what you're doing!

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:58.900
You killed Patrick and Joyce and 
Holly like insects, didn't you?

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:02.340
Does it matter?

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:03.830
The bioweapon would have killed them anyway.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:08.600
And you intend to torture Akari and 
the XO before you kill them, right?

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.720
They're very rare creatures.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:14.060
Of course we're going to study them.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:15.770
I'll tell you something!

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:18.110
People without morals

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:21.910
are generally just dumbasses who don't know 
when things are about to get really bad.

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.390
It's not enough.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:29.950
It's not enough at all.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:34.340
There's not enough rage, and not enough 
fear that you're about to die!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.990
Looks like you finally feel 
like you're in danger.

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:53.180
Not that it matters now, though.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:56.480
You're the one in danger, aren't you?

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:02.720
I have infinite possibilities, but the 
possibility that you even survive is nil.

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:05.280
That's been the case my whole life.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:10.000
I've survived this long by 
struggling and fighting

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.000
in situations where I 
could die at any moment.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.830
Come and get me, dumbass.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:29.250
No matter how many of you 
come, I'll kick your ass!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.890
<b>M.A.R.S. Ranking 9
Marcos Eringrad Garcia
No.1 Division
Surgery Base: Heteropoda venatoria</b>

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.310
Tell me your answer already, please.

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:44.370
Will Rome join the alliance between 
the US, Japan, and Germany?

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:45.940
No.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:47.320
We refuse.

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:50.580
What about you? Are you okay with this?

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:54.820
Just getting the leftovers 
from Japan and the US.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:20:02.400
Are you willing to let America steal the 
other research project Germany is working on?

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:06.510
Similar research is going 
on everywhere, right?

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:10.380
That's the other reason why everyone

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:13.920
wants the virus samples. 
Not just for medical reasons.

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:18.690
Yes. But Germany is farther 
along than anyone.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.270
And we want it.

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:26.660
The research that will allow the Martian 
Alien Engine virus samples

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:31.290
to drastically increase the success 
rate of Mosaic Organ operations.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:38.310
The reason all the Branches are cooperating 
is not to help America make a vaccine.

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:41.170
It's so that their country 
can benefit the most.

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:44.320
Which country is the strongest,

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:48.500
and who will achieve their goal, depends 
on the battle taking place on Mars.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:50.940
This is a proxy war.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.450
And we have Joe.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:57.300
We can fight against the US and 
Japan's mass-produced Seconds.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:00.920
Join us, Germany.

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:08.190
Yes, you're right.

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:24.800
Jirou?

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.700
<i>Brother, bad news.</i>

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.510
<i>No. 4 Division got there first.</i>

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:33.310
<i>Their heavily-armed "rescue 
ship" is about to land on Mars.</i>

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:38.560
Several of them got inside, it seems.

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:42.140
Hong-chan, it's time to stop playing around.

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:44.250
Kill them with your full-power poison.

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.980
Silent Fists

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:40.540
If you die right now, then 
I'll fall in love with you.
